Homepage: https://wiki.gnome.org/Accessibility

Package: at-spi2-core
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         at-spi2-common,
         gsettings-desktop-schemas,
         libatspi2.0-0t64 (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Assistive Technology Service Provider Interface (D-Bus core)
 This package contains the core components of GNOME Accessibility.
 .
 This build has no X11 support: the accessibility bus and the registry
 run without any X11 code. See the README of this package in the crick
 Debian backports repository.

